I wrote `results/2026-10-22.raw.json` with 8 candidates, not the 15 or more the brief asks for. I didn't have enough evidence for more. I didn't gather the 40 to 60 candidates the pipeline calls for, and I didn't open the file after writing it to check it parses.

**What the evidence covers.**
